# Images are split by PROVENANCE, not by format, because the two kinds
# carry different rights and only one of them may be published.
#
# This directory root: images supplied by the owner — licensed stock,
# their own photographs. NOT committed. A stock licence is granted to
# you, not to everyone who clones this, and this repository is public:
# committing a licensed image here republishes it to the whole internet
# as a standalone downloadable file, which is exactly what those licences
# forbid. Keep them here, upload them, leave them out of git.
#
# generated/: artwork this project owns outright (AI-generated originals,
# 2026-08). No third party's rights attach to it, so it IS committed —
# which makes the catalogue reproducible from a clean checkout instead of
# depending on the Supabase bucket never being emptied.
#
# Both are named after the product type and share one namespace at upload
# time; a file in this root overrides a generated one of the same name,
# so replacing generated artwork with a real photograph later is just
# dropping the file in beside the folder (see ../scripts/upload-images.mjs).
*
!.gitignore
!README.md
!generated/
